  "title": "Simple British Flapjack",
  "description": "Kids will have fun making these easy British flapjacks - sweet, sticky bars of oats, raisins, and golden syrup, quick to bake and finished with a chocolate drizzle.",
  "authors": [
    "kuppet"
  ],
